      <activity id="fa513558-bf88-5829-9d34-178ab7a43922" activityNameId="f8032223-f910-5e75-9bd7-18fd3fd607fc" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Ethylene glycol dimethyl ether, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Ethylene glycol dimethyl ether, at plant
The process "ethylene glycol dimethyl ether, at plant, GLO" is modelled for the production of  ethylene glycol dimethyl ether from ethylene oxide in Europe  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation, Energy consumptions,  emissions, infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000110-71-4; 
Formula: C4H10O2; 
UUID: 77e5a70f-3215-3336-a51d-dc37a1ec0926
Production of ethylene glycol dimethyl ether including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Reaction of ethylene oxide and dimethyl ether
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Standard values 
Extrapolations: Energy consumptions,  emissions, infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_77e5a70f-3215-3336-a51d-dc37a1ec0926.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
